// package's sections) for counts, technical gaps and unresolved
// dependencies, and the final report of each session for what remains NOT
// DONE within the stage's own scope.
//
// Stage 3 (26.09.2026): the remaining unclassified owned sections — 346(a),
// 361 (module 17), 367 (module 18), 385 and 1552 (module 19), 543(d) with the
// Pub. L. 119-21 section 70302 edition split (module 20), the year-keyed
// section 11(b) maximum-rate export (module 01), and the section 367(e)(2)
// wiring into section 337(a) (module 06). Sections 12 and 1505 are
// cross-reference tables; the statutory notes are classified in
// coverage/corporations.json. See HANDOFF.md "corporations — стадия 3".
//
// Stage 2 (25.09.2026): section 312 (E&P adjustment machinery, module 09),
// section 316(a) "most recently accumulated" pro rata/chronological
// ordering (module 02 extension), sections 368(a)-(b) reorganization types
// and continuity (module 10), 354/355/356 (module 11), 303/304/306/307
// (module 12), 338 (module 13), 381-384 (module 14), Subchapter G
// 531-537/541-547/561-565 (modules 15-16). See HANDOFF.md "corporations —
